PLACEHOLDER: NOT A KEY YET.

This file will hold the public half of UpNext's pacman signing key, the key
that signs the Arch package and the repository database on every release.
The key hasn't been made yet; docs/dev/RELEASE.md,
"Making the signing key", says how, and step 4 there replaces this text with
the key itself. Until then the release workflow builds no repository, and
pacman-key refuses this file.
